# Productions/ holds large, mostly-gitignored run data. Track ONLY: this file, the
# import-time deps (Intersection_vocab/, Black_list_models_in_runs.json), and the
# committed zero-download smoke subset (FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/). Everything else
# (the 4.2 GB+ runs, generated outputs, etc.) stays ignored.
#
# This mirrors the negations in the repository-root .gitignore; do not remove either.
*
!.gitignore
!Intersection_vocab/
!Intersection_vocab/**
!Black_list_models_in_runs.json
!FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/
!FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/**
# Re-ignore local classification run-output under the light subset (logs/checkpoints + the
# generated banned_token_pairs.json) — NOT part of the committed feature_computation_data/.
# This nested .gitignore wins over the root for paths under Productions/, so the re-ignore
# must live here; mirrored in the repo-root .gitignore per the note above.
FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/Experiments/Batch_Classification_across_token_pairs/
FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/Experiments/banned_token_pairs.json
